    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1150460/extras/f3e605d5f978a8ea98d09c61a4afa07f.poster.avif?t=1615050657\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1150460/extras/f3e605d5f978a8ea98d09c61a4afa07f.webm?t=1615050657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1150460/extras/f3e605d5f978a8ea98d09c61a4afa07f.mp4?t=1615050657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Summer days, warm rain, magical nights! Sleeping kittens are hidden well. Can you find them?<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  18 handcrafted summer islands<br></li><li>  with over 100 sleeping cats for you to find and wake up<br></li><li>  and lots of sea shells to collect<br></li><li>  so open boxes, search the forests, look inside tents and under umbrellas<br></li><li>  and solve puzzles<br></li><li>  charming music<br></li><li>  no timers, no scores, it's just you and lovely islands and kittens </li></ul>",
